  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows three conducting coils. There is an increasing counterclockwise current in coil Q and as a result, currents are induced in the other two coils.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the direction of the induced current in coil P and the direction of the induced current in coil R?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of induced current in P</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of induced current in R</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Clockwise</td>\n<td>Clockwise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Clockwise</td>\n<td>Counterclockwise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Counterclockwise</td>\n<td>Clockwise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Counterclockwise</td>\n<td>Counterclockwise</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
